# List filter panel

Use `@webonone/ui-kit` **`ListSearchField`**, **`ListFilterTrigger`**, and **`ListFilterPanel`** on any `FeaturePage` that displays a filterable collection (`ItemList` + `Pagination`).

Skill: [.cursor/skills/item-list/SKILL.md](../skills/item-list/SKILL.md) · pagination: [item-list-pagination.mdc](item-list-pagination.mdc).

Reference: `ui-kit/package/src/components/ListSearchField.tsx`, `ListFilterPanel.tsx`, `email/frontend/src/features/history/pages/HistoryPage.tsx`.

## When required

- Page shows a paginated or slice-paginated **collection list**
- User can narrow results by search text, status, date, or similar criteria

## Pattern

```tsx
<FeaturePage
  title="…"
  actions={
    <div className="flex w-full flex-wrap items-center justify-end gap-2">
      <ListSearchField
        value={searchQuery}
        onChange={setSearchQuery}
        placeholder="Context-specific hint"
      />
      <ListFilterTrigger active={hasActiveFilters} onClick={() => setFilterOpen(true)} />
    </div>
  }
>
  <ListFilterPanel
    open={filterOpen}
    onOpenChange={setFilterOpen}
    onApply={handleApply}
    onClear={handleClear}
  >
    {/* FormField + Select / DatePicker — not text search */}
  </ListFilterPanel>
  <ItemList>…</ItemList>
  <Pagination … />
</FeaturePage>
```

| Rule | Detail |
|------|--------|
| Search left of filter | `ListSearchField` always **before** `ListFilterTrigger` in `actions` |
| Right-aligned row | Wrap actions in `flex w-full flex-wrap items-center justify-end gap-2` |
| Forbidden body search | Do **not** place `ListSearchField` as a `FeaturePage` child above the list |
| Fixed-width expand | `ListSearchField` uses `w-10 shrink-0` anchor; expanded input is `absolute right-0` so the filter icon does not shift |
| Mobile actions | `PageHeader` actions row uses `justify-end` on mobile |
| Panel scroll lock | `ListFilterPanel` sets `body overflow: hidden` while open |
| Text search in header | Use `ListSearchField` — collapsed search icon expands to input with left search icon + clear |
| Panel filters only | Status, dates, MIME type, etc. — not primary text search |
| No inline filter forms | Do not add full-width `<Form>` rows above lists |
| `active` trigger | `true` when any **panel** filter ≠ default (search is separate) |
| Apply | Reset pagination to page 1; refetch (server) or re-slice (client) |
| Placeholder | Match list domain (`"Company name"`, `"Template name or slug"`, …) |

Search-only pages (no panel filters) may use **`ListSearchField` alone**.

## Exceptions

- Auth, embed, and form-only pages (no collection list)
- Single-card pages (e.g. Providers)
- Media embed routes — search + filter in `ScopedFolderBrowser` toolbar

## Verification

```bash
npm run type-check -w <service-root>
```
